the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    the Alter of *a case* is *a number*; scenario element.
    the Einkommen of *a case* is *a number*; scenario element.
    the Schufa Score of *a case* is *a number*; scenario element.
    the Bürgschaft vorhanden of *a case* is *a truth value*; scenario element.
    Hauptprüfung holds for *a case*.
    Antragsteller volljährig holds for *a case*.
    Standardprüfung Bonität holds for *a case*.
    Einkommensprüfung holds for *a case*.
    Alternative Prüfungen holds for *a case*.
    Schufa Score holds for *a case*.
    Bürgschaft vorhanden holds for *a case*.
    Antragsteller volljährig would hold for *a case*; unknown.
    Einkommensprüfung would hold for *a case*; unknown.
    Schufa Score would hold for *a case*; unknown.

the knowledge base r6_2_credit_check_referenced_twice includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/credit-check-referenced-twice.ruml".

Hauptprüfung holds for a case if
    Antragsteller volljährig holds for the case
    and Standardprüfung Bonität holds for the case
    and Alternative Prüfungen holds for the case.

Antragsteller volljährig holds for a case if
    the Alter of the case is a number N
    and N >= 18.

% Where the expression has no result (a value it needs is missing), RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Antragsteller volljährig holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Alter of the case is a number
    and Antragsteller volljährig would hold for the case.

Standardprüfung Bonität holds for a case if
    Einkommensprüfung holds for the case
    and Schufa Score holds for the case.

Alternative Prüfungen holds for a case if
    Standardprüfung Bonität holds for the case.

Alternative Prüfungen holds for a case if
    Bürgschaft vorhanden holds for the case.

Einkommensprüfung holds for a case if
    the Einkommen of the case is a number N
    and N > 30000.

% Where the expression has no result (a value it needs is missing), RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Einkommensprüfung holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Einkommen of the case is a number
    and Einkommensprüfung would hold for the case.

Schufa Score holds for a case if
    the Schufa Score of the case is a number N
    and N >= 600.

% Where the expression has no result (a value it needs is missing), RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Schufa Score holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Schufa Score of the case is a number
    and Schufa Score would hold for the case.

Bürgschaft vorhanden holds for a case if
    the Bürgschaft vorhanden of the case is true.

